# Thrashing Brontodon: "{1}, Sacrifice this creature: Destroy target artifact or enchantment." (CR 115.1, 602.2b). With none on the
# battlefield (Black Lotus was sacrificed to cast it) the ability can't be activated (turn 1). Once Bot2 has a Fastbond, an Elvish Mystic and
# a Forest, only the enchantment is a target: the creature and the land are refused beside it, and the destroyed Fastbond is the positive
# control. The Brontodon is sacrificed as a cost.

